---
// Pipeboard Official Partnership — AI-native Ad Operations on Meta & Google Ads
---

<section class="pipeboard-partnership" id="pipeboard-partnership">
    <div class="pp-container">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="pp-header">
            <span class="pp-label">
                <span class="pp-label-pulse"></span>
                PARTENER OFICIAL · PIPEBOARD
            </span>
            <h2>Campanii <span class="gradient-text">Meta & Google Ads</span> conduse de AI, la cel mai înalt nivel.</h2>
            <p>WebSEM este partener oficial Pipeboard. Folosim AI-ul lor enterprise ca strat de comandă peste Google Ads și Meta Ads — <strong>creăm</strong>, <strong>analizăm</strong> și <strong>optimizăm</strong> campanii prin agenți inteligenți care văd întreg contul în timp real.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Hero Card -->
        <div class="pp-hero-card">
            <div class="pp-hero-glow"></div>
            <div class="pp-hero-grid"></div>

            <div class="pp-hero-inner">
                <div class="pp-logos">
                    <!-- WebSEM -->
                    <div class="pp-logo pp-logo--websem">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                            <rect x="2" y="2" width="28" height="28" rx="7" fill="url(#pp-websem-grad)"/>
                            <path d="M8.5 11.5l3.5 9 4-7 4 7 3.5-9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                            <defs>
                                <linearGradient id="pp-websem-grad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="32" y2="32">
                                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#667eea"/>
                                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#764ba2"/>
                                </linearGradient>
                            </defs>
                        </svg>
                        <span>WebSEM</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pp-connector">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 80 24" fill="none">
                            <path d="M5 12h70" stroke="url(#pp-conn-grad)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
                            <defs>
                                <linearGradient id="pp-conn-grad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="80" y2="0">
                                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#667eea"/>
                                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#22d3ee"/>
                                </linearGradient>
                            </defs>
                            <circle r="3" fill="#22d3ee">
                                <animateMotion dur="2s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M5 12h70"/>
                            </circle>
                        </svg>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Pipeboard mark -->
                    <div class="pp-logo pp-logo--pipeboard">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                            <rect x="2" y="2" width="28" height="28" rx="7" fill="url(#pp-pb-grad)"/>
                            <path d="M9 22V10h6.5a4 4 0 0 1 0 8H12v4H9zm3-6.5h3a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3h-3v3z" fill="#fff"/>
                            <circle cx="22" cy="11" r="2.2" fill="#fff"/>
                            <defs>
                                <linearGradient id="pp-pb-grad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="32" y2="32">
                                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0ea5e9"/>
                                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#1e40af"/>
                                </linearGradient>
                            </defs>
                        </svg>
                        <span>Pipeboard</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="pp-hero-meta">
                    <div class="pp-meta-row">
                        <span class="pp-meta-label">Status</span>
                        <span class="pp-meta-value">
                            <span class="pp-status-dot"></span>
                            Partener Oficial Activ
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pp-meta-row">
                        <span class="pp-meta-label">Platforme conectate</span>
                        <span class="pp-meta-value pp-meta-value--mono">Meta Ads · Google Ads</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pp-meta-row">
                        <span class="pp-meta-label">Mod de operare</span>
                        <span class="pp-meta-value pp-meta-value--mono">AI-native · Real-time</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- What is Pipeboard - Explainer -->
        <div class="pp-explainer">
            <div class="pp-explainer-header">
                <h3>Ce face <em>Pipeboard</em> diferit?</h3>
                <p>Nu e încă un tool de raportare. E un <strong>strat AI executiv</strong> care vede tot contul tău publicitar și acționează ca un specialist senior — în secunde, nu în zile.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="pp-feat-grid">
                <div class="pp-feat-card">
                    <div class="pp-feat-icon pp-feat-icon--blue">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 1 1-4 0v-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1-1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 1 1 0-4h.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51-1 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83-2.83l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33h0a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 1 1 4 0v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51h0a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 1 1 2.83 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82v0a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 1 1 0 4h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Creație de campanii</h4>
                    <p>Brief în limbaj natural → campanie Meta sau Google complet structurată: ad sets, creative, audiences, targeting.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="pp-feat-card">
                    <div class="pp-feat-icon pp-feat-icon--cyan">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 20V10"/><path d="M18 20V4"/><path d="M6 20v-4"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Analiză & insights</h4>
                    <p>AI-ul analizează cohorte, search terms, ad fatigue, geo-performance, hour-of-day — și extrage acțiunile cu impact real.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="pp-feat-card">
                    <div class="pp-feat-icon pp-feat-icon--purple">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"/><polyline points="1 20 1 14 7 14"/><path d="M3.51 9a9 9 0 0 1 14.85-3.36L23 10M1 14l4.64 4.36A9 9 0 0 0 20.49 15"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Optimizare continuă</h4>
                    <p>Bid-uri, bugete, keywords negative, audiențe — ajustate live pe baza performanței și a sezonalității.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="pp-feat-card">
                    <div class="pp-feat-icon pp-feat-icon--gradient">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 2 2 7v10l10 5 10-5V7l-10-5z"/><path d="M2 7l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M12 22V12"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Auction insights</h4>
                    <p>Vizibilitate completă pe competiție: cine licitează contra ta, share of voice, overlap rate, position above rate.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- AI Workflow Visualization -->
        <div class="pp-workflow">
            <div class="pp-workflow-header">
                <span class="pp-workflow-label">CUM OPERĂM</span>
                <h3>Workflow AI cu Pipeboard — 4 etape, 24/7</h3>
                <p>Agentul AI rulează continuu peste contul tău. Noi îl supervizăm, decidem strategia, validăm fiecare schimbare critică.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="pp-workflow-steps">
                <div class="pp-step">
                    <div class="pp-step-num">01</div>
                    <div class="pp-step-icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Discovery</h4>
                    <p>AI-ul scanează contul: ce funcționează, ce sângerează buget, unde sunt oportunitățile latente.</p>
                    <div class="pp-step-tags">
                        <span>GAQL queries</span>
                        <span>Search terms</span>
                        <span>Geo perf</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="pp-step-arrow">→</div>

                <div class="pp-step">
                    <div class="pp-step-num">02</div>
                    <div class="pp-step-icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M9 11H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Plan & Brief</h4>
                    <p>Strategul WebSEM transformă insight-urile în plan: noi campanii, ad groups, audiențe, mesaje per persona.</p>
                    <div class="pp-step-tags">
                        <span>Persona match</span>
                        <span>ICP brief</span>
                        <span>Funnel map</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="pp-step-arrow">→</div>

                <div class="pp-step">
                    <div class="pp-step-num">03</div>
                    <div class="pp-step-icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Execuție AI</h4>
                    <p>Pipeboard creează campaniile, RSA-uri, sitelinks, callouts, audiences — totul în câteva minute, validate de noi.</p>
                    <div class="pp-step-tags">
                        <span>Campaign create</span>
                        <span>RSA build</span>
                        <span>Audience sync</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="pp-step-arrow">→</div>

                <div class="pp-step">
                    <div class="pp-step-num">04</div>
                    <div class="pp-step-icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-9-9c2.52 0 4.93 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"/><path d="M21 3v5h-5"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Optimizare 24/7</h4>
                    <p>Bid adjustments, pause keyword non-profitabil, scale ad set winning, negative keywords — automat și auditate.</p>
                    <div class="pp-step-tags">
                        <span>Bid mgmt</span>
                        <span>Neg KW</span>
                        <span>Budget shift</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Capabilities Matrix -->
        <div class="pp-matrix">
            <h3 class="pp-matrix-title">Capabilități tehnice prin parteneriatul Pipeboard</h3>

            <div class="pp-matrix-grid">
                <div class="pp-matrix-col">
                    <div class="pp-matrix-platform">
                        <div class="pp-platform-logo pp-platform-logo--google">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z" fill="#4285F4"/><path d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z" fill="#34A853"/><path d="M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.07H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.93l2.85-2.22.81-.62z" fill="#FBBC05"/><path d="M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.07l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.53 6.16-4.53z" fill="#EA4335"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Google Ads</h4>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="pp-cap-list">
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Campanii Search, PMax, Shopping</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Responsive Search Ads automate</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Sitelink, Callout, Snippets</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Keyword bid management</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Negative keywords AI-curated</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Audience targeting & lookalike</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>GAQL queries personalizate</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Geo & device targeting</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="pp-matrix-col">
                    <div class="pp-matrix-platform">
                        <div class="pp-platform-logo pp-platform-logo--meta">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10 10-4.5 10-10S17.5 2 12 2zm-1 15.5c-1.93 0-3.5-1.57-3.5-3.5 0-2.5 2-4.5 3.5-7 .8 1.3 2 3 3 5.5l-1 .5c-.5-1.3-1.2-2.5-2-3.5-1 1.5-2 3-2 4.5 0 1.4 1.1 2.5 2.5 2.5h.5l-.5-1c-.3-.7 0-1.5.7-1.8.7-.3 1.5 0 1.8.7l1 2c-.5.6-1.4 1.1-2.5 1.1zm5.5-3.5c0 1.93-1.57 3.5-3.5 3.5-.5 0-1-.1-1.4-.3-1-2-2-4-3.6-7L9 9.5c1.5 2.5 2.5 4.2 3 5.5.3.6 1 1 1.5 1 1 0 1.5-.6 1.5-1.5 0-1.5-1-3-2-4.5-.8 1-1.5 2.2-2 3.5l-1-.5c1-2.5 2.2-4.2 3-5.5 1.5 2.5 3.5 4.5 3.5 7z" fill="#0866FF"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Meta Ads</h4>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="pp-cap-list">
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Campanii Facebook & Instagram</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Advantage+ Shopping</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Creative testing automatizat</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Custom & Lookalike Audiences</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Pixel & CAPI integration</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Catalog feed pentru e-commerce</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Retargeting flows complete</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Budget allocation cross-camp</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="pp-matrix-col">
                    <div class="pp-matrix-platform">
                        <div class="pp-platform-logo pp-platform-logo--ai">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
                        </div>
                        <h4>Strat AI WebSEM</h4>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="pp-cap-list">
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Strategie & supervizare umană</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Brief AI cu context business</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Aprobare schimbări critice</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Cross-platform anti-canibalizare</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Compliance & brand safety</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Raportare săptămânală cu insight</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>A/B test design senior</li>
                        <li><span class="pp-check"></span>Integrare cu CRM-ul tău</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stats Strip -->
        <div class="pp-stats">
            <div class="pp-stat">
                <div class="pp-stat-value">24<span>/7</span></div>
                <div class="pp-stat-label">Monitoring AI continuu</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-stat">
                <div class="pp-stat-value">~5<span>min</span></div>
                <div class="pp-stat-label">De la brief la campanie live</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-stat">
                <div class="pp-stat-value">2<span></span></div>
                <div class="pp-stat-label">Platforme integrate (Meta + Google)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-stat">
                <div class="pp-stat-value">100<span>%</span></div>
                <div class="pp-stat-label">Acțiuni audit-ate de senior strategist</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Why It Matters -->
        <div class="pp-why">
            <div class="pp-why-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M13 2 3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-why-text">
                <strong>De ce parteneriatul Pipeboard schimbă jocul</strong>
                <span>Avem acces la API-urile lor enterprise pentru Google Ads și Meta Ads, plus suport tehnic prioritar și early access la noi capabilități AI. Pentru clienții noștri asta înseamnă <em>execuție mai rapidă, decizii mai inteligente, buget mai eficient</em> — și un strateg senior care supervizează fiecare mutare AI-ul o face.</span>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .pipeboard-partnership {
        padding: var(--section-padding);
        background: var(--bg-primary);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .pp-container {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Header */
    .pp-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .pp-label {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        color: var(--accent-light);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
        padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-accent);
        border-radius: 100px;
        background: var(--alpha-bg);
    }

    .pp-label-pulse {
        width: 6px;
        height: 6px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #22d3ee;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.7);
        animation: pp-pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pp-pulse {
        0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.7); }
        70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0); }
        100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34, 211, 238, 0); }
    }

    .pp-header h2 {
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
        max-width: 820px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
    }

    .pp-header p {
        color: var(--text-tertiary);
        font-size: 1rem;
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .pp-header p strong {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .gradient-text {
        background: var(--gradient-text);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        background-clip: text;
    }

    /* Hero Card */
    .pp-hero-card {
        position: relative;
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .pp-hero-grid {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background-image:
            linear-gradient(rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
            linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
        background-size: 40px 40px;
        mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 0%, transparent 70%);
        -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 0%, transparent 70%);
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .pp-hero-glow {
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        width: 60%;
        height: 200%;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12) 0%, transparent 50%);
        pointer-events: none;
        animation: pp-glow-drift 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pp-glow-drift {
        0%, 100% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); opacity: 0.7; }
        50% { transform: translate(-45%, -50%) scale(1.1); opacity: 1; }
    }

    .pp-hero-inner {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 2.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .pp-logos {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .pp-logo {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.65rem;
        padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
        background: var(--bg-secondary);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);
        border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .pp-logo svg {
        width: 32px;
        height: 32px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .pp-logo span {
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .pp-connector {
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .pp-connector svg {
        width: 80px;
        height: 24px;
    }

    .pp-hero-meta {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 280px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.65rem;
    }

    .pp-meta-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem;
        padding: 0.6rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-light);
    }

    .pp-meta-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    .pp-meta-label {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .pp-meta-value {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        font-weight: 600;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .pp-meta-value--mono {
